      "value": "@{60285ca04963ba22994f485b|full_name}: I had this issue because VRC started on my 3rd monitor by default. This resulted in it defaulting to it's 60Hz instead of the 144Hz of my main Monitor. Giving VRC the launch option -monitor 1 fixed this issue for me.\nIt's weird though that it defaulted to my 3rd monitor instead of my main one.",
