      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I had this problem as well. went from 165 fps (monitors max rate) to 59 and below in desktop mode (didn't test in vr) the workarounds below (launch commands) and one additional thing simply lowering the process priority of EAC so it functions but doesn't use max cpu cycles fixes the slowdown without compromising the purpose of EAC .   Task-manager>right click EAC>go to details> right click>priority >set to low.  EAC often has performance issues on many games and often its just a simple bottle necking issue. Let VRC know if this works for you  Photo showing proof of fix and vanilla client running as intended.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
